This application is being developed for Safe Families for Children (https://safefamilieswi.org/)
as a general Case Management system. The development tools are:
- Programming Language: PHP 8.2
- Framework: Laravel 12
- Database: MariaDB 10.5
- Frontend: Bootstrap 5, Blade templates
- Asset Management: Vite
- JavaScript Tools: jQuery, Select2, TypeScript (via Vite)
- IDE: Visual Studio Code
- Server Environment: Ubuntu (production), Windows (development)
- Additional Packages: Spatie Laravel-Permission, Livewire

- Other Tools: DBeaver 25.03 (database management app)